# Paths are relative to rootDir (src/), so only the manifest and the .gs files
# are pushed. Anything else that ever lands in src/ is excluded by default
# rather than by being listed — safer as the project grows.
#
# The default-deny is the right shape and it has one failure mode: a new *kind*
# of file is dropped in silence. `clasp push` lists what it sent and says
# nothing about what it skipped, so a file of a kind not admitted here stays
# behind while the push reports success. `tests/manifest.test.mjs` fails if
# anything under src/ is not pushable, which is the one thing a file test can
# prove here.
**/**
!appsscript.json
!*.gs
